{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a love letter to all games that involve catching objects! There is a wide assortment of gameplay styles, visual themes, and world-class music to experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch the thingies by moving the paddle. Dodge the thangies by moving the paddle. Can it truly be that simple? Download the game and find out!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out what Falling Thingies has to offer by playing the demo!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 of 6 levels zones are available to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless modes for both zones are available to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contribute to your vault progress which carries forward from the demo to the main game</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681350?t=1749674970","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681350/7d2edacb89414128660345c44f8198f3e2876337/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749674970","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681350/400cde5974d25101b54fc0203d59cb85a6eedfa1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749674970","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681350/400cde5974d25101b54fc0203d59cb85a6eedfa1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749674970","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a love letter to all games that involve catching objects! There is a wide assortment of gameplay styles, visual themes, and world-class music to experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"